                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Formaat: MP3<br>Omvang: 2,9 Mb<br>Creator: Robert Peston<br>Online beschikbaar:<http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/business/7688308.stm> [01-12-2014]</p><p>Samenvatting:</p><p>Audio Slideshow: A guide to the credit crunch. It seems as though the term 'credit crunch' is becoming common parlance. But do you know what it actually is - or how it came about? Spend a few minutes with the BBC's Business Editor Robert Peston, as he explains why we are in the middle of a global financial crisis.</p>"
